# Link stubs for the PC build: symbols that are dead code for a
# single-player PC boot. pc/gen_stubs.py turns each entry into a weak,
# loud trap (func) or weak zeroed storage (data).
#
# This list is checked in and explicit on purpose. The generator never
# reads unresolved.txt or link.log, if it did, the link gate would stop
# meaning anything. A new genuinely-missing symbol must still break the
# link; stubbing it is a deliberate act of adding a line here.
#
# Format: SYMBOL<TAB>func|data<TAB>one-line reason (goes into the trap message)
